  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAMBDA-NEW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lambda &#x2013; is a human rights organization funded in 2006 with a main mission of lead the LGBT movement and mobilize the society, making it more favorable to the promotion and guarantee of the economic, political and social rights of LGBT citizens. Since its inception Lambda promotes the rights of the LGBT community in Mozambique, essentially go through legal reform in order to ensure the existence of inclusive social policies. In this program the network organization will recruit LGBTIQ community members to be trained as peer educators who will take a responsibility to achieve their pairs and offer provide services.</narrative>
  </description>
